      "comment": "airom:source airom (medium severity)",
      "creationInfo": "_:creationInfo",
      "description": "The GGUF tokenizer.chat_template contains Jinja sandbox-escape gadgets; rendering a prompt with it can execute code. Found: __globals__, os.popen.",
      "name": "AIROM-RISK-GGUF-TEMPLATE",
      "spdxId": "https://airom.dev/spdxdocs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000#Vulnerability-0-airom-risk-gguf-template",
      "summary": "Unsafe GGUF chat template",
      "type": "security_Vulnerability"
    },
    {
      "comment": "airom:source airom (high severity)",
      "creationInfo": "_:creationInfo",
      "description": "A Keras model config declares a Lambda layer, which marshals arbitrary Python that executes when the model is loaded. Found: Lambda.",
      "name": "AIROM-RISK-KERAS-LAMBDA",
      "spdxId": "https://airom.dev/spdxdocs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000#Vulnerability-1-airom-risk-keras-lambda",
      "summary": "Keras Lambda layer",
      "type": "security_Vulnerability"
    },
    {
      "comment": "airom:source airom (medium severity)",
      "creationInfo": "_:creationInfo",
      "description": "The SavedModel graph contains a PyFunc-family op, which invokes arbitrary Python during inference. Found: PyFunc.",
      "name": "AIROM-RISK-SAVEDMODEL-PYFUNC",
      "spdxId": "https://airom.dev/spdxdocs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000#Vulnerability-2-airom-risk-savedmodel-pyfunc",
      "summary": "SavedModel Python-callback op",
      "type": "security_Vulnerability"
    },
    {
      "comment": "airom:source airom (medium severity)",
      "creationInfo": "_:creationInfo",
      "description": "A source call site deserializes a model through an unsafe path (e.g. torch.load with weights_only=False); a malicious checkpoint would execute code on load.",
      "name": "AIROM-RISK-UNSAFE-LOAD",
      "spdxId": "https://airom.dev/spdxdocs/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000#Vulnerability-3-airom-risk-unsafe-load",
      "summary": "Unsafe model deserialization",
      "type": "security_Vulnerability"
    },
    {
      "comment": "airom:source airom (high severity)",
      "creationInfo": "_:creationInfo",
      "description": "A pickle GLOBAL resolves to a code-execution callable; loading this artifact runs code before any model is produced. Found: os.system.",
